TFT (ILI9341) ↔ ESP8266 (NodeMCU/Wemos D1 mini) wiring:

ESP8266 <-> ILI9341 TFT Connections

TFT VCC   -> 3.3V
TFT GND   -> GND
TFT CS    -> D8 (GPIO15)
TFT RESET -> D4 (GPIO2)
TFT DC    -> D3 (GPIO0)
TFT MOSI  -> D7 (GPIO13)
TFT SCK   -> D5 (GPIO14)
TFT LED   -> 3.3V
TFT MISO  -> D6 (GPIO12)   [optional]

NOTE: Use 3.3V only, do NOT connect to 5V
